      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Habitat host: reviewed runner + AICL policy/approvals + funding + inference proxy + purchase broker + SQLite/audit.\nSeller service: catalog, checkout and fulfillment; holds its own merchant credentials. PayPal and model provider are external.\nOptional MCP facade exposes the controlled purchase tools; it does not replace owner consent or AICL authorization.",
